<title>USA: Fed's overnight fixed system RPs total $2.841 bln.</title>
<headline>Fed's overnight fixed system RPs total $2.841 bln.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Reserve's overnight system repurchase agreements on Wednesday totalled $2.841 billion, a New York Fed spokeswoman said.</p>
<p>On Tuesday, the Fed's nine-day system RPs were $2.955 billion.</p>
<p>(( -- N.A. Treasury Desk, 212-859-1860 ))</p>
</text>
